@startuml
title Rate Management System State Diagram

[*] --> StartDate
StartDate -|> WaitingState

state WaitingState
state ActiveState
state ExpiredState
state ArchivedState

ActiveState -|> ValidityPeriod
ExpiredState -|> ExpirationDate
ArchivedState -|> OneYearAfterExpirationDate

StartDate --> EndDate: once_reached
EndDate --> ActiveState: activate_rate
ValidityPeriod --> ExpiredState: reach_finish_date
ExpiredState --> ArchivedState: one_year_passed
@enduml
